{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026060422514-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026121924\"/><p>元朗發生爆竊案。昨日(25日)晚上11時04分，執法部門接獲一名姓侯(68歲)女住戶報案，指其位於錦綉花園松濤南路一獨立屋，發現一扇門被撬，屋內有被搜掠痕迹，懷疑遭賊人爆竊。</p><p>警員接報到場，經女戶主初步點算後，相信有共值約34.9萬港元的財物不見了，包括兩隻手錶、兩粒金粒、兩條頸鏈、港元現金及人民幣。經初步調查後，案件列「爆竊」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.938092+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:04:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:16.056853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:48.745357+00:00","content_hash":"d230f1e5375241afb30e69ac5cb03b3f457e2a2050bc332ac2247f9b2e044c4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.938092+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}